<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>PM5 Bluetooth probe</title>
    <%# No trailing slash on this route, deliberately: "js/probe.js" then resolves to "/js/probe.js"
        the way the asset actually sits. index.erb forces the opposite because it is served under a
        Tailscale Funnel sub-path; this page is a local instrument and never is. %>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="vendor/pico.cyan.min.css" />
    <style>
      code { font-size: .8rem; word-break: break-all }
      table { font-size: .85rem }
      td, th { padding: .2rem .4rem }
      #log { max-height: 18rem; overflow-y: auto; font-size: .85rem; padding-left: 1rem }
      #log li { list-style: none }
      .count { text-align: right }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <main class="container">
      <h1>PM5 Bluetooth probe</h1>
      <p>
        Connect the erg, let it walk the GATT tree, then <strong>row for about thirty seconds</strong>
        so the notifying characteristics have something to say — a PM5 reports per stroke, so a
        stationary erg looks identical to a silent one. Then send the report; it lands in
        <code>probe-reports/</code> in the checkout.
      </p>
      <p>
        <button id="pm5">Connect PM5</button>
        <button id="any" class="secondary">Connect anything…</button>
        <button id="send" class="contrast" disabled>Send report</button>
      </p>
      <div id="tree"></div>
      <h2>Log</h2>
      <ol id="log"></ol>
    </main>
    <script type="module" src="js/probe.js"></script>
  </body>
</html>
